{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_st01",
  "title": "晚风轻拂",
  "storyCode": "CB-ST1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bfd54c74c64e4c1afda01c5db6962a708bfdd3b1c79971685a5e226f0ce6edb0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n......以前的日子里，我一直以为我是个出色的信使。\n信使，运送货物、信件。\n也许是思念，也许是财富，也有时候，会带去毁灭。\n父亲是个厉害的人物，从米诺斯到龙门，他建立了峯驰物流。\n利益，谄媚，党同伐异。\n这些东西很复杂，也很麻烦，但我勉强能应付。\n但父亲告诉过我......\n大地的彼端会更精彩一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔！我这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在嘟囔什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醒了的话，就安静点，否则有你好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，等首领解决了企鹅物流，会来处理你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我......被这些家伙......德克萨斯他们还在和黑手党交战吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（该死......为什么我一点用场都派不上......我可是峯驰物流的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......车停了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我们，首领把那个丰蹄小子抓住了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你要做什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是卡彭先生的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡彭？这可是首领的命令！他胆敢僭越——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我胆敢什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，峯驰物流的小少爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我们第一次正式见面，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你射杀了自己的同伴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惩罚叛徒可没有违背龙门的规矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是指这个......你想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做一笔交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "显而易见，甘比诺的匹夫之勇会让家族溺毙在所谓的荣光里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我并不想，相当一部分人并不想，做无意义的陪葬，谁会想呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会帮助你对付甘比诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不可能信任你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也能帮助你对付企鹅物流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是傻子。在龙门待了很多年，我早就在做多种准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父亲大权在握，占据龙门七成以上的民事信使工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，和龙门高层有一些战略合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论怎么看，企鹅物流都是你们事业上最大的障碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的目标只是接手企鹅物流的全部渠道。欠下这个人情，咱们之间的生意可以再议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父亲和大帝先生相交莫逆，很遗憾，你的猜测不过是自以为是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "峯驰物流这样的庞然大物，真的只是你父亲说了算吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你似乎有点小看我们，也许如今的家族已经在多次偶然的失败中损耗殆尽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但很久以前，我们的祖辈可是曾在叙拉古那些漆黑的议事桌上，骄傲的自称“西西里人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "权利不断轮换，血肉模糊，而我耳濡目染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实话实说吧，你父亲身边的那些人对企鹅物流是怎么想的？对龙门是怎么想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又是怎么想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你口口声声在强调家族，刚才却亲手杀了自己的家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得我会接受你的提议吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的死只是单纯的......利益交换。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，天知道你们支付的会是钞票还是炸药。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——很遗憾，我本以为你会更加成熟一点。你却要为了一个与你无关的小小纰漏而丧命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你害怕了。就算身为峯驰物流的部门经理，你也只是个乳臭未干的臭小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不好意思，米诺斯的年轻人，向来都是以大胆出名的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你还是不打算改变主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你能活下去的话，你会见到更多这种事，可惜现在，你只有死路一条。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啧——！这绳子怎么这么牢，来不及了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕你死了，峯驰物流按捺不住，说不定还会牵扯出龙门近卫局，局势会变得更加混乱，对我来说，也是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交谈很短暂，说再见吧，小少爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，可你对拜松出手的话，就不属于惩罚叛徒的范畴了喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说你觉得在这里就结束，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "路过的信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我对你有印象，长角的萨科塔，今晚你给我们添了不少麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常荣幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从没有在企鹅物流的任何情报中听说过你，你到底是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我有必要回答你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是来找我丢失的包裹的，嗯，就像普通的信使那样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡彭先生，我们已经控制了这个据点。这里都是支持您的人，她孤立无援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？还是要动手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是没关系，随时奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......普通的信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必，箭在弦上，我们各自都有要做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡彭先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想送死你自己去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是为了活下去才做这一切的，不要本末倒置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别说得那么吓人，我真的只是一个普通的信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长角的萨科塔人说自己普通，谁会相信呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我无意和你战斗，请便吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才还要杀人灭口，转眼就愿意放人了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑手党的生活就是这样，充满了太多我不喜欢的意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，既然小少爷不愿意合作，又很难去死，那我只好去找找别的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有机会的话，今天晚些时候见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿那个时候，你们已经被甘比诺解决掉了，或者，反过来也行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他真的走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已经给自己松绑了吧？要搭把手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，我自己能起来。谢谢帮忙，莫斯提马小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，从你脸上的表情看来，被折腾的不轻吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们的，节奏有点太快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我提醒过你，那么，他们人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克萨斯说要去“大地的尽头”。一个小时后在那里集合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了，我来给你带路吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那大地的尽头......这个名字，到底意味着什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......这个名字的由来已经不可考了，现在算是老板的私人财产，也是据点之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来自各地的人士趋之若鹜，至少在地下势力之间很有名吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那究竟是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实就是一家酒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐，我们这是在做什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲在桌布里伪装成一个大号幽灵，这可是最便利的化妆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我问的是，我们为什么要伪装成一个大号幽灵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "符合安魂夜的气氛嘛，其他人只会觉得我们是在搞什么活动喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才那位“卡彭先生”可没有走太远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然出现一个长着黑角的萨科塔人，还拿着法杖，气势汹汹——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像他那种总觉得一切要尽在掌握的家伙，总会小心翼翼的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法杖......我才注意到，原来莫斯提马小姐是源石技艺的使用者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久以前的事情了，真要说，我也是接受过系统训练的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和天天睡觉偷懒的能天使完全不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐果然和能天使小姐是旧识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，原本，我们应该在吵闹的迎新派对上畅所欲言才对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过偶尔发生点爆炸和袭击也是应该的。毕竟是企鹅物流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该的吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意外吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在想莫斯提马小姐这样的信使也会有这样的时候......毕竟有着那么多谜一样的传言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失望了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！没有！我这么说是不是有点太失礼了，抱歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟我也是企鹅物流的一员，信使出没在这片大地的各个角落，“随机应变”可是员工须知的第一条。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一条的版本越来越多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我回忆一下，这里，往左，再往右，然后在第三个巷口拐弯......嗯，我们抄一条近路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间已经这么晚了，但街上的人却越来越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是安魂夜的魅力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很有意思吧？外面有花车店铺和安魂夜派对，而这里只有难闻的下水道蒸汽，只不过一墙之隔而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很有意思，是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间很紧，我们得加快脚步了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cenmetery"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是，墓地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊，会把墓地建在市中心的城市也只有龙门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那些人，都穿着丧服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肃穆的哀悼，让人想起在拉特兰的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰......那是一个什么样的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很好奇吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧。我其实一直想去更远的地方看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我什么时候才有机会揽到国际信使合同呢......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城际网络比过去发达多了，总会有离开城市的机会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而且，越遥远的距离，承载的意义也就越重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穿越国家与国家之间的旅程，很艰辛吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......真要说的话，最大的问题是天灾吧。如果不小心撞上了，那你面对的敌人会是整个泰拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前因为在中转站的时候遗落了天灾信使的报告，所以遇上了那么一次，虽然离着好几座山头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌云密布而下坠，暴虐的天空与你为敌，这种感觉很不好，相当不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天灾......如果是移动城市的话，应该不会被直击吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也有很多别的麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城市为了躲避天灾而移动城区，原本近在眼前的目的地就那么渐行渐远，你想象一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还真是糟糕，太糟糕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以一定要和天灾信使的同僚们打好关系。以及，一定不要在他们定期联络的时候打瞌睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘿嘿，这么一聊，莫斯提马小姐才更像个同行嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，对不起，是我有些松懈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——莫斯提马小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？啊，抱歉，想起了点事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们需要穿过墓地，脚步放轻点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "ac5_4_back"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道安魂夜的由来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么突然提起这个？我记得，似乎和萨卡兹们的古老祭祀有关系......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安魂夜其实来源于古代萨卡兹们的某种祭祀活动，很久以前，这个名字的意义要更加复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部分节日都和祭祀啊，崇拜啊有关吧。只是人们在不断忘却。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人们迎回逝者的灵魂，在安魂夜抚平他们留存人间的执念，转入轮回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在很少有人把这些东西当真了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生者们歌舞升平地扮演幽灵，真正的亡者却在墓地里无人问津，这可不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许有时候，经历的事情太多，就会想要靠遗忘来安抚自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都经历了很多事情。毕竟这世上最不缺的就是灾难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是看着那些献花的扫墓人，心情总归会平静一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cenmetery"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，莫斯提马小姐，你刚才似乎说过要抢回自己的包裹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没说过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人付了一大笔钱委托我，委托内容是“带拜松见见世面”，嗯，很有风格的委托吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老、老爹......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你的考察成绩如何，其实也看我的意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这么晚，都没人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃百家饭长大的崽，真是说不见就不见，什么矿石病，是你自己想太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "董阿伯过得很好，生意一直不差。这两天还带了个小学徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于你嘛，就是不让人省心，不肯好好做生意，要去混......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老婆子，你少说点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都像你一样没良心？快点蜡烛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我火呢......哦，这儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，这臭小子学抽烟那会，人也不见了。现在突然想起来，从来没给他递过火，遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蜡烛多不得劲，我给你点支烟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臭老头，你真点烟？没大没小的，快换蜡烛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，点上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿发......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，安魂夜不许哭丧，走吧，时候不早了，回家让董小子给咱们炒个肠粉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大半夜的吃什么肠粉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老奶奶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......年轻人，谢谢你带我们来这里，晚上看不清路，帮了大忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没关系，顺路罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，起风了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有点凉意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清爽的夜风，还有股糖果的甜味，以及灯火辉煌的城市夜景，这才是龙门一绝呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看见那片黄金色的浮夸街道了吗？像午夜的太阳一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，那就是目的地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "日落大道东1301号，门口有巨大的企鹅涂鸦，很好认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来的路，你得自己走过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鹅涂鸦......我明白了，但是莫斯提马小姐呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯——我总不能一直护在你身边吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒是没错......但莫斯提马小姐上次也是这样突然消失......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉啦，怎么说我也有其他的工作在身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要和大家好好相处喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我尽力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，回头见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......董阿伯，发生什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿孑？你没事就好，快回家里去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是谁？码头的人？还是那些学生混混？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，都不是，这次你就别管了，人没大碍就行，吃点小亏，多大的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......老头老太今天去给阿发那小子扫墓，你不认识，算是他们半个孙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看老人家回来得晚，就想做点菜送过去，然后就遇到那些人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁动的手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......反正不是龙门人，你就别掺和了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿孑！你好不容易才解除了和鬼姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和星熊警官的误会，不是给你介绍了工作吗？好好珍惜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，阿伯就先好好休息吧"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去看看情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿孑，臭小子，你回来，你去哪儿？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉！怎么就是不肯听话！这臭小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后生们有所为有所不为，你心里早该乐开花了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......林？你来干嘛？看我出糗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为龙门最好的鱼丸师傅，你不应该冒这个险，告诉他们又何妨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王在哪里有那么重要吗？要是大家吃不到最好的鱼丸，该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "规矩就是规矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这破规矩都是我们定的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那也是规矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你白挨了一顿打。我没打算一直躲躲藏藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸，天知道你打的什么算盘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，我扶你起来。当了这多年鱼丸师傅，身手退步了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真动了手，回头又要被人盯上，你帮我摆平？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只想安安静静过日子，挨顿打就挨顿打吧，又没少挨过打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，看到老伙计们都这么有精神，我也放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你才是他们的目标，你放心个屁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样才放心啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你总是这样，不累吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "累得很，但毕竟不是过去了，我们都有各自的责任，我们肩负着一座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卖你的鱼丸，别的不关你事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走得动吗？陪我遛个弯如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，这才多大事——痛痛痛！你干嘛！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "皮肉伤也是伤，老样子，死逞强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不要再想过去的事情了，这是你选择的生活，没必要愧疚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的鱼丸也是龙门的一部分，比我更重要的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已经自由了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我怎么不见你来照顾我的生意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——换个话题吧，你最近过得如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实我听说哥伦比亚盛行龙门料理，我打算找机会去那儿发展发展——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
